# UI Glass + Theme

Changes MUST pass Enterprise Score Theme/A11y ≥ 9.

## Theme Engine
- Controlled via `theme` state (`dark` | `light`), synced to `<html>` class and `localStorage`
- Ensure `@custom-variant dark (&:where(.dark, .dark *));` is respected in Tailwind v4

## Contrast Hierarchy (Strict)
- Headers / Titles: `text-slate-900 dark:text-white`
- Primary Values / Figures: `text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-100`
- Subtitles & Hints: `text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300`
- Field Labels: `text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 font-semibold tracking-wide uppercase text-[11px]`
- Badges & Pills: `bg-slate-100/90 dark:bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-300 dark:border-white/10 text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-200`
- Inactive Nav / Tabs: `text-slate-600 hover:text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-400 dark:hover:text-white`

## Tactile Motion (No Skeuomorphic Tilts)
- Rest state: `translate-y-0`
- Hover state: `hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition-all duration-150`
- Active state: `active:scale-[0.985] active:translate-y-0`
- Glow: Specular hairline top border `border-t-white/30 dark:border-t-white/20`
- MUST NOT use `rotateX`, `rotateY`, `perspective`, or skewed shadows
